flowchart LR
    UI[Streamlit / MCP client] --> API[FastAPI]
    API --> RET[Hybrid retrieval]
    RET --> LEX[Lexical]
    RET --> VEC[MiniLM CPU / Qdrant]
    LEX --> RRF[RRF fusion]
    VEC --> RRF
    RRF --> STU[MiniLM student]
    STU --> GATE[Gain-aware gate]
    GATE -->|easy| OUT[Ranked results]
    GATE -->|hard| FIRST[FIRST replay/provider]
    FIRST --> OUT
    API --> PG[(PostgreSQL events)]
    API --> REDIS[(Redis state/cache)]
    VEC --> QD[(Qdrant vectors)]
    API --> PROM[Prometheus]
    PROM --> GRAF[Grafana]
